      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CHANGES (7) has been excellent of late and made it two wins in a row at this circuit and distance when he came from the back row to score by 2.4m at his latest appearance. Cops a wide draw but is going well enough to overcome that. PAIGES BOULDER (3) has not raced for four-and-a-half months but showed ability in a short maiden campaign, winning at this circuit and distance when last seen. Has upside and looks forward enough after winning a recent trial. Should enjoy an economical run from this draw so expecting a bright start to the campaign. PASSION AND PAIN (8) owns a decent record at this circuit and distance and was good when he came from this barrier and finished runner-up at Menangle on Tuesday, beaten only 1.4m. REVVIN REYNARD (6) showed pleasing improvement last time out when third from a wider barrier at this circuit and distance.",
